<title>USA: CCC says its seeks 25,470T spring wheat for Ghana.</title>
<headline>CCC says its seeks 25,470T spring wheat for Ghana.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA's Commodity Credit Corp said Tuesday it will tender April 15 to buy 25,470 tonnes northern spring wheat for donation to Ghana.</p>
<p>The wheat will May 1-25 shipment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
